.TH DANBY-HIV 1
.SH NAME
danby-hiv \- initial spread and progression of HIV
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/hiv
.SH MODEL
S'=-beta SI;
I'=beta SI-delta I;
A'=delta I-mu A.
.PP
I represents infected people before AIDS, and A the progressed compartment.
The model is deliberately an initial-spread model: it omits treatment,
heterogeneous contact networks, and demographic replacement.  It is an
educational compartment model, not a clinical forecast.
.SH CONTROLS
Drag any compartment bar.  Tracks set effective contact, progression, and AIDS
mortality.  Space pauses, period steps, r resets, and q exits.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/hiv.b
.br
.B /appl/temple/hiv.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR populationmodel (2),
.IR danby-epidemic (1)
